  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msqrt><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>.</mo></math> Then which one of the following is correct?"
